AijooysZT7NeaydK2knqK-w","summary":[],"status":"completed"},{"type":"message","id":"rs_77ff62a4-da56-4f78-9ca0-afb18289132e","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Measurements ready — writing up the clear-up and construction orders.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_957dea88-46cc-4d08-ad26-235790d5efbc","call_id":"call_957dea88-46cc-4d08-ad26-235790d5efbc","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H1\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the black cable off the walkway in the walkthrough and secure it along the wall by the power strip.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道上的黑色電線移開走道，沿著有排插的牆邊固定收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_7d99ea73-a654-47f0-8cbd-0c2b43a93380","call_id":"call_7d99ea73-a654-47f0-8cbd-0c2b43a93380","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H2\",\"instruction_en\":\"Tape an A4 sheet upright on the lower door frame next to the wooden threshold in the walkthrough doorway and re-take the photo.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請在走道門口木門檻旁的下門框上，直立貼一張A4紙，重新拍照。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_dc03f5ea-3e24-450a-aa8c-8e60ff4e2d82","call_id":"call_dc03f5ea-3e24-450a-aa8c-8e60ff4e2d82","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H3\",\"instruction_en\":\"Remove the red patterned rug in the walkthrough or flatten it and tape its edges to the floor against the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道靠牆處的紅色花紋地毯收走，或鋪平並將邊緣貼牢固定。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_9418886d-7e33-4b36-b3d5-c7424bc0e2ca","call_id":"call_9418886d-7e33-4b36-b3d5-c7424bc0e2ca","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H4\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the black cable off the rug and wooden doorway threshold in the walkthrough and secure it out of the walkway.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道上橫跨地毯和木門檻的黑色電線移開走道，並固定收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_497c4bf7-1067-4762-94f6-f39d1fffa88c","call_id":"call_497c4bf7-1067-4762-94f6-f39d1fffa88c","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H5\",\"instruction_en\":\"Pick up the black cable with plug from the tiled hallway floor in the walkthrough and store it away from the walkway.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道磁磚地上斜放的黑色插頭電線拿起，收放到走道以外的地方。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_abf46290-73f2-4dc1-887e-fc858241c597","call_id":"call_abf46290-73f2-4dc1-887e-fc858241c597","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H6\",\"instruction_en\":\"Pick up the light-colored lace-up sneakers from the tiled floor in the walkthrough and put them in a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道磁磚地上的淺色綁帶運動鞋拿起，放到鞋櫃裡。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_cd8e2eec-7410-411c-bcd2-2bc4a15fc116","call_id":"call_cd8e2eec-7410-411c-bcd2-2bc4a15fc116","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H7\",\"instruction_en\":\"Pick up the light-colored sneakers from the floor in the walkthrough and put them in a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道地板上的淺色舊運動鞋拿起，放到鞋櫃裡。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_9fc9d0c5-a65b-4fbf-b44c-e143f916eb04","call_id":"call_9fc9d0c5-a65b-4fbf-b44c-e143f916eb04","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H8\",\"instruction_en\":\"Pick up the dark blue slippers from the tiled floor in the walkthrough and put them in a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道磁磚地上的深藍色拖鞋拿起，放到鞋櫃裡。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_2fd1d1cf-68b5-4d82-aeaf-674c9d3404b4","call_id":"call_2fd1d1cf-68b5-4d82-aeaf-674c9d3404b4","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H9\",\"instruction_en\":\"Pick up the dark blue slide slippers from the tiled floor in the walkthrough and put them in a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請將走道磁磚地上的深藍色便鞋拖鞋拿起，放到鞋櫃裡。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_a2044c1e-f924-46e2-9590-8764d85dff51","call_id":"call_a2044c1e-f924-46e2-9590-8764d85dff51","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H10\",\"instruction_en\":\"Install a fixed grab bar on the wall next to the toilet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"請在馬桶旁的牆上安裝固定式扶手。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"FA22\"}","status":"completed"}]